<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέξ-οδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with no outlet, not to be
				got out of impassable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					12.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσχωρίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαβύρινθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.93
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα ἀ.</span>”
				<i>unfit for an expedition,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.269e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
			conditions, etc., <i>not coming into public, unsocial,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				242e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				426b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1098d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάνοια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					610a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι ἀ.</span>”
				<i>without practical result,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					1034b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
